WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.405
Peter: I'm hungry!

2
00:00:06.406 --> 00:00:11.221
Minwoo: Uh-oh. An ant!

3
00:00:11.222 --> 00:00:13.449
Sally: How many ants?

4
00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:18.557
Minwoo: One ant. Two ants. Three ants . . .

5
00:00:18.558 --> 00:00:24.208
Peter: Six ants. Seven ants. Eight ants.

6
00:00:24.209 --> 00:00:28.321
Minwoo: Uh-oh. A bee!

7
00:00:28.322 --> 00:00:30.468
Sally: How many bees?

8
00:00:30.469 --> 00:00:35.156
Minwoo: One bee. Two bees. Three bees . . .

9
00:00:35.157 --> 00:00:40.787
Peter: Run!

